+ *  1. vocal continuity (gap budget, mid-line guard, spotlight);
+ *  2. buildup-aware blends (B-side buildup, flanger, quiet-intro guard);
+ *  3. vocal separation tier (incoming vocal stays crisp, outgoing mid
